<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus's November CPI up 0.05 pct month/month.</title>
<headline>Cyprus's November CPI up 0.05 pct month/month.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus's CPI increased 0.05 percent in November to 117.90 points from 117.84 in October, the island's statistics and research department said.</p>
<p>    Consumer price index	 Nov 96    Oct 96    Nov 95</p>
<p>    Month/month change (pct)   0.05	 0.88     0.73</p>
<p>    Year/year change (pct)     2.29	 2.99     1.39</p>
<p>    Index (1992=100)	     117.90     117.84   115.25</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
